"Play long-term games with long-term people." - Naval Ravikant

The best communities are built on trust and shared long-term vision.

The long-term vision for Vibe with AI is to be the most fun and approachable brand for the world to learn AI from.

Society needs to learn AI, but most people don't know it yet!

To get to know one another,r please introduce yourself below.

